{"root":{"data":{"id":"4ebdbbc9b795","created":1539072371,"text":"网络是如何连接的","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"boybmr5xdb0g","created":1539072398705,"text":"浏览器生成消息","priority":1,"expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"boybmybba48w","created":1539072414268,"text":"生成HTTP请求消息","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"boybobaxfx8g","created":1539072520907,"text":"浏览器解析URL","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"boybop00w5q8","created":1539072550723,"text":"根据HTTP协议生成HTTP请求消息（最终会收到响应消息）","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"boybmz35cj5s","created":1539072415951,"text":"向DNS服务器查询Web服务器的IP地址","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"boyc15w53thc","created":1539073527863,"text":"原因：浏览器需要知道接收方的IP地址，可网址中只有WEB服务器域名","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"boybpj9quu4g","created":1539072616614,"text":"IP地址含义，域名和IP区别","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"boybpx5ln1mo","created":1539072646838,"text":"Socket库提供查询（Web服务器）IP地址的功能","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"boyc4laz51xc","created":1539073796504,"text":"Socket库是用于调用网络功能的程序组件集合。","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"boybpxsutips","created":1539072648244,"text":"通过解析器resolver向DNS服务器发出查询","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"boybmza0ih34","created":1539072416366,"text":"DNS服务器接力查找","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"boybraxwkao0","created":1539072755212,"text":"DNS服务器","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"boyc5npo9728","created":1539073880111,"text":"来自客户端的查询消息：1域名 2Class（目前都是IN） 3记录类型","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"boyc6ubpr3ls","created":1539073972868,"text":"DNS服务器会从域名与IP地址的对照表中查找相应的记录，并返回IP地址。","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"boyc5h93nyf4","created":1539073866048,"text":"域名的层次结构","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"boyc7blrq328","created":1539074010482,"text":"一台DNS服务器可以存放多个域的信息","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"boyc87xgyhog","created":1539074080846,"text":"根域 DNS服务器在运营上使用多台服务器来对应一个 IP 地址，故尽管IP 地址只有 13 个，其实服务器的数量是很多的。","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"boybrcehos1s","created":1539072758392,"text":"寻找相应的DNS服务器并获取IP","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"boybrcmkvabk","created":1539072758881,"text":"通过缓存加快DNS服务器响应","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bp0miw4jn474","created":1539306248171,"text":"DNS 服务器有缓存功能，可以记住之前查询过的域名（不需要从最上级的根域开始查找）","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"boyca49nvabk","created":1539074229605,"text":"如果要查询的域名和相关信息已经在缓存中，可以直接返回响应，接下来的查询可以从缓存的位置开始向下进行","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bp0mj87z64g0","created":1539306274500,"text":"相比每次都从根域找起来说，缓存可以减少查询所需的时间。","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"boybmzkf9kow","created":1539072416996,"text":"委托协议栈发送消息（TCP）数据收发操作","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"boybs1w3b9xc","created":1539072813876,"text":"创建套接字","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"boybs28gpxq8","created":1539072814624,"text":"把管道连接到服务器端的套接字上：接上管道","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"boybsogbitj4","created":1539072862988,"text":"通信：传递消息，收发数据","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"boybsoqlkoow","created":1539072863609,"text":"断开管道并删除套接字：收发数据结束","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"boybu04s2uww","created":1539072966776,"text":"协议栈和网卡：TCP/IP数据传输","priority":2,"expandState":"collapse"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"boybuukczhfk","created":1539073033021,"text":"TCP协议栈收发消息","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"boybws2t991c","created":1539073184335,"text":"创建套接字","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"boybx39zbls0","created":1539073208713,"text":"协议栈内部结构","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"boybx8frgjk0","created":1539073219946,"text":"套接字实体","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"boycjjsivj7k","created":1539074968674,"text":"协议栈内部有一块存放控制信息的内存空间，记录了控制信息（控制通信操作），例如通信对象的 IP 地址、端口号、通信操作的进行状态等。","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"boycjvze58n4","created":1539074995211,"text":"套接字只是概念并不存在实体，如果一定要赋予它实体，控制信息可以视作套接字的实体，或者说存放控制信息的内存空间就是套接字的实体。","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"boyck320oidc","created":1539075010607,"text":"套接字的作用：协议栈需要根据套接字中的控制信息判断下一步的行动","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"boyckbaur4sg","created":1539075028556,"text":"协议栈是根据套接字中记录的控制信息来工作的。","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"boybx8jwz30g","created":1539073220198,"text":"创建套接字的操作过程","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"boycmpf7qh34","created":1539075216023,"text":"协议栈根据应用程序的申请执行创建套接字的操作","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"boycn3roieps","created":1539075247251,"text":"协议栈首先分配一个内存空间，用于存放一个套接字；然后写入表示初始状态的控制信息","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"boycp1wnrojk","created":1539075399927,"text":"将套接字的描述符告知应用程序。描述符是区分协议栈中多个套接字的号码牌。","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"boycpsoyxjwg","created":1539075458235,"text":"应用程序在向协议栈进行收发数据委托的时候就需要提供这个描述符。","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"boybwskkkgsg","created":1539073185409,"text":"连接服务器（connect）","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"boycqchekav4","created":1539075501314,"text":"创建套接字之后，应用程序(浏览器)就会调用 connect，随后协议栈会将本地的套接字与服务器的套接字进行连接","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"boycsqqfkbgg","created":1539075689063,"text":"目的","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"boycqzk30qo0","created":1539075551542,"text":"连接操作是为了指定收发数据的对象，将服务器的IP地址和端口号告知协议栈","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"boycrl298zr4","created":1539075598353,"text":"连接操作也是为了传达开始通信的请求","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"boycu45w2m0w","created":1539075796660,"text":"作用","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"boyct8wqc000","created":1539075728626,"text":"通信双方交换控制信息，在套接字中记录这些必要信息并准备数据收发","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"boycvd6yxnuo","created":1539075894681,"text":"执行数据收发操作时需要一块用来临时存放要收发的数据的内存空间，这块内存空间称为缓冲区，它也是在连接操作的过程中分配的","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"boycxv9tlerk","created":1539076090763,"text":"控制信息","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"boycxy7uayv4","created":1539076097174,"text":"头部中记录的信息","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"boycytdd4mbk","created":1539076164988,"text":"客户端和服务器相互联络时交换的控制信息。","layout_right_offset":{"x":7,"y":-5}},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"boycz0zis4qo","created":1539076181565,"text":"头部信息在连接时、数据收发和断开连接操作的整个通信过程中都需要，因此写在头部"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"boycxyommf40","created":1539076098189,"text":"套接字（协议栈中内存空间）中记录的信息","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"boycznrwolj4","created":1539076231171,"text":"实际过程：connect(< 描述符 >, < 服务器 IP 地址和端口号 >, ...)","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"boyd04y4d2ww","created":1539076268552,"text":"在TCP模块处创建表示连接控制信息的头部。","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"boyd0aw8bhfk","created":1539076281498,"text":"通过TCP头部中的发送方和接收方端口号可以找到要连接的套接字。","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"boyd10vmqpz4","created":1539076338058,"text":"相当于有一根管子把两个套接字连接了起来，Connect执行完毕，控制流程交回到应用程序","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"boybwsqumb5s","created":1539073185788,"text":"收发数据","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"boyd361xadc0","created":1539076506051,"text":"HTTP请求消息交给协议栈","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bozaq3309erk","created":1539171398589,"text":"协议栈将数据存放在内部的发送缓冲区，由应用程序判断发送的数据长度","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bozb1mu5kr28","created":1539172303595,"text":"判断要素1:每个网络包能容纳的数据长度","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bozb2raph5vk","created":1539172391667,"text":"MTU（Maximum Transmission Unit，最大传输单元）:一个网络包的最大长度，以太网中一般为1500字节。"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bozb2rmx0o3k","created":1539172392405,"text":"MSS（Maximum Segment Size，最大分段大小）:除去头部之后，一个网络包所能容纳的TCP数据的最大长度。"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bozb4yw5noqo","created":1539172564930,"text":"长度要素优先：提高网络效率；也可能因为等待填满缓冲区产生延迟"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bozb1n4yy0hs","created":1539172304249,"text":"判断要素2:时间","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bozb3uja5ts0","created":1539172477080,"text":"协议栈内部有计时器，即使缓冲区数据长度没有达到MSS，为避免因等待时间过长而出现延时，应直接发送网络包"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bozb5erpzuo0","created":1539172599490,"text":"时间要素优先：延迟时间变少，但会降低网络效率"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"boyd3dhnl5og","created":1539076522240,"text":"拆分较大数据","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bozb8oxda39c","created":1539172856692,"text":"发送缓冲区中的数据超过 MSS 的长度，数据会被以 MSS 长度为单位进行拆分，拆分出来的数据会被放进单独的网络包中。","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"boyd3jupssu8","created":1539076536090,"text":"使用ACK号确认网络包收到","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bozba8d1wphc","created":1539172977363,"text":"确认响应，根据序列号确认有无遗漏","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bozbao1y8wzk","created":1539173011521,"text":"实际通信序号初始值都是随机数（安全原因，避免重复）","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"boyd3tigo9a8","created":1539076557117,"text":"根据网络平均往返时间调整ACK号等待时间","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bozbfuzak8ao","created":1539173418418,"text":"网络拥堵ACK号返回变慢，调整ACK等待时间（超时时间）避免重传","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bozbgpxnbjls","created":1539173485799,"text":"网络情况复杂，TCP根据ACK返回时间动态调整等待时间","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"boyd4dth3vuo","created":1539076601319,"text":"使用窗口有效管理ACK号","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bozbial9ngn4","created":1539173609127,"text":"等待ACK号返回时，会直接发送后续的包，有效利用资源","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bozbj68x2v40","created":1539173678037,"text":"接收缓冲区存在溢出风险：接收方在TCP头部的窗口字段告知能接受的数据量","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"boyd4lzuu5mo","created":1539076619119,"text":"ACK与窗口的合并","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bozblzpqvojk","created":1539173898910,"text":"窗口大小（缓存区的容量）需要更新，可以跟ACK号合并发送","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bozbmonjdclc","created":1539173953196,"text":"连续发送多个ACK号或窗口动态更新时，可合并发送：只发送最后一个ACK和窗口状态","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"boyd4rblod1c","created":1539076630713,"text":"接收HTTP响应消息","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bozbo0dcr5z4","created":1539174057066,"text":"协议栈会检查收到的数据块和 TCP 头部的内容，判断是否有数据丢失，如果没有问题则返回 ACK 号。","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bozboxfy7j7k","created":1539174129057,"text":"协议栈将数据块暂存到接收缓冲区中，并将数据块按顺序连接起来还原出原始的数据，最后将数据交给应用程序","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bozbp5hrytxc","created":1539174146582,"text":"协议栈将接收到的数据复制到应用程序指定的内存地址中，然后将控制流程交回应用程序，并找到合适的时机向发送方发送窗口更新 。","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"boybxsihpe68","created":1539073263647,"text":"从服务器断开连接并删除套接字","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bozbps64b3sw","created":1539174195943,"text":"数据发送完毕，断开连接","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bozbqbgg2eio","created":1539174237926,"text":"TCP四次挥手","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bozbqlwtr11c","created":1539174260685,"text":"删除套接字（等待一段时间后，端口解除占用）","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"boybvjtm0rnk","created":1539073088000,"text":"IP与以太网的包（实际网络包）收发","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"boybwaurzh8g","created":1539073146844,"text":"含义：协议栈与网卡配合，将数据切分成小块，封装成网络包，再将网络包转换成电信号/光信号","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bozbtdum1e68","created":1539174478228,"text":"包（packet）的结构","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bozbtowfgsu8","created":1539174502283,"text":"头部：目的地址等控制信息  e.g.快递单","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bozbtrkyyjgg","created":1539174508120,"text":"数据 e.g.包裹里的货物","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bozc1lsuknb4","created":1539175122449,"text":"包的收发操作","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bozc2a3podts","created":1539175175350,"text":"发送","layout_right_offset":{"x":-18,"y":0},"expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bozc2e9aphq8","created":1539175184394,"text":"TCP模块：TCP头部（通信对象的IP地址）+数据块（网络包内容）--》传递给IP模块","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bozc3tkqh8g0","created":1539175296101,"text":"IP模块：IP头部+MAC头部+TCP模块","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bozc58blw4xs","created":1539175406565,"text":"IP用的头部，含IP地址","layout_right_offset":{"x":-31,"y":2},"expandState":"collapse"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bozcbq65gx6o","created":1539175915602,"text":"包含 IP 协议规定的、根据 IP 地址将包发往目的地所需的控制信息"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bozc8nvb8t1c","created":1539175675501,"text":"IP模块的IP地址由TCP模块告知，TCP模块由应用程序告知","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bozc9kfa1wcg","created":1539175746365,"text":"IP头部中的发送方地址，由于网卡不唯一，所以需要根据路由表判断"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bozc5d08hon4","created":1539175416761,"text":"以太网用的头部，含MAC地址","layout_right_offset":{"x":-26,"y":-2},"expandState":"collapse"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bozcce91uiv4","created":1539175968020,"text":"包含通过以太网的局域网将包传输至最近的路由器所需的控制信息"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bozccowgjxts","created":1539175991204,"text":"MAC 头部的开头是 接收方和发送方的 MAC 地址"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bozcd7pcutc0","created":1539176032133,"text":"根据IP地址查询MAC地址（ARP）Address Resolution Protocol地址解析协议：路由表Gateway栏的内容"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"bozc6ai8gr9c","created":1539175489684,"text":"封装好的包交给网络硬件（网卡）--》由01数字信息转成电信号或者光信号--》以太网，无线局域网","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bozclhx6cl4w","created":1539176681287,"text":"接收","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bozcm2t1bi80","created":1539176726749,"text":"通过网卡将信号转为数字信息，校验后把包交给协议栈","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bozcnn4qscg0","created":1539176849357,"text":"IP模块将分片的包还原，交给TCP模块","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bozco563nhmo","created":1539176888621,"text":"TCP模块查找对应套接字，根据套接字记录的通信状态，执行操作","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"bozcemkzsyrk","created":1539176142885,"text":"以太网","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bozcf6flbbwg","created":1539176186094,"text":"将包发送到 MAC 头部的接收方 MAC 地址代表的目的地","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bozcfdh85qm8","created":1539176201430,"text":"用发送方 MAC地址识别发送方","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bozcfgwtywow","created":1539176208904,"text":"用以太类型识别包的内容","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bozchodc3egw","created":1539176381868,"text":"网卡","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bozcicsz991c","created":1539176435057,"text":"缓冲区：临时保存要收发的包的内存空间","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bozcidhrs3y8","created":1539176436556,"text":"MAC：控制碰撞检测(收发信号叠加无法区分)、重发等以太网收发操作的部分，生成通用信号","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bozcidmm78cg","created":1539176436849,"text":"PHY（MAU）：收发信号的电路，将数据转成可在网线中传输的格式，并发送","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bozcidrqe6m8","created":1539176437158,"text":"RJ-45接口：连接网线的插座","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"boybw00zwdmo","created":1539073123275,"text":"UDP协议收发数据","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bozcpctt2y9s","created":1539176983656,"text":"从应用程序获取数据，加上UDP头部交给IP发送","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"bozcr76l6cqo","created":1539177128097,"text":"网络设备：集线器/交换机/路由器","priority":3,"expandState":"collapse"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bozcsh99pla8","created":1539177228391,"text":"信号在网线和集线器中传输","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bozctig2h9ts","created":1539177309343,"text":"每个包都是独立传输（邮差只看信封，不管包内容）","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bozcz8wki60w","created":1539177758758,"text":"网线中的信号衰减","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bozd0c77s934","created":1539177844297,"text":"双绞线的缠绕方式帮助抑制噪声","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bozd0odfpzpc","created":1539177870793,"text":"集线器将信号发往它所连接的所有线路（广播到整个网络）：如果同时输入多个信号就会发生碰撞，无法同时传输多路信号","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bozcsp8lfpxc","created":1539177245764,"text":"交换机的包转发","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bozd1ukeos8w","created":1539177962640,"text":"交换机根据地址表进行转发，但交换机的MAC模块不具有MAC地址，因此交换机只能单纯进行转发","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bozd2u423thc","created":1539178040015,"text":"交换机根据MAC地址表查找MAC地址，然后将信号发送到相应的端口。","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bozd2whzm1og","created":1539178045211,"text":"MAC地址表的维护","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bozd38b6msxs","created":1539178070921,"text":"每次收到包都记录发送方的MAC地址和端口号","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bozd3mqx44cg","created":1539178102348,"text":"地址表中的记录一段时间不使用就自动删除","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bozd3yvvr1fk","created":1539178128769,"text":"地址表中的记录一旦监测到改变就会自动进行更新","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bozd4y2hvlkw","created":1539178205356,"text":"交换机无法判断要把包转发的端口，就会把包广播发给除了源端口之外的全部","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bozd62xrmm0w","created":1539178294318,"text":"交换机的全双工模式","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bozd777mzrb4","created":1539178381987,"text":"同时进行收发，优势：不需要碰撞处理机制，数据量更大/速度更快/性能更高","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bozd7ew7cgzk","created":1539178398709,"text":"自动协商全双工模式和半双工模式切换，确定最优传输速率","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bozd8c3kddkw","created":1539178470988,"text":"交换机可以同时执行多个转发操作","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bozcswa22x34","created":1539177261090,"text":"路由器的包转发","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bozd9yzxj1ts","created":1539178599199,"text":"路由器结构","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bozda2yct05c","created":1539178607811,"text":"转发模块：判断包的转发目的地(akin to IP模块 ）","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bozda38cgcn4","created":1539178608415,"text":"端口模块：负责包的收发操作（akin to网卡）","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bozdc7r5lkw0","created":1539178774988,"text":"支持除局域网的多种通信技术","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bozdcr202zuo","created":1539178817002,"text":"路由器的各个端口都具有MAC地址和IP地址。","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bozdcuxdufi8","created":1539178825430,"text":"路由表","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bozdd1tl9m2o","created":1539178840438,"text":"路由器根据“IP地址”判断转发目标。","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bozdd8n805q8","created":1539178855291,"text":"路由器会忽略主机号，只匹配网络号","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bozdebnluznk","created":1539178940208,"text":"路由表的子网掩码列只表示在匹配网络包目标地址时需要对比的比特数量。","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bozdeztonh8g","created":1539178992819,"text":"网关（目标IP地址）和接口（网络端口）","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bozdewim6m80","created":1539178985619,"text":"跃点计数，它表示距离目标 IP 地址的距离是远还是近","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bozdfmhze58g","created":1539179042177,"text":"维护","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bozdhakanq4g","created":1539179172924,"text":"手动维护","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bozdhhm52uww","created":1539179188273,"text":"根据路由协议机制，通过路由器之间的信息交换动态更新","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"bozdhrszbytc","created":1539179210454,"text":"路由器的包接收","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bozdhxxnrri8","created":1539179223798,"text":"路由器的端口都具有MAC地址，只接收与自身地址匹配的包， 遇到不匹配的包则直接丢弃。","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bozdiec69a80","created":1539179259504,"text":"查询路由表确认输出端口","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bozdin22fny8","created":1539179278484,"text":"通过路由器转发的网络包，其接收方MAC地址为路由器端口的 MAC地址。","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bozdjb4exs00","created":1539179330869,"text":"ICMP:Internet Control Message Protocol，Internet 控制报文协议。当包传输过程中发生错误时，用来发送控制消息。","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bozdjhcvn0g0","created":1539179344441,"text":"路由表中找不到匹配路由时选择默认路由","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bozdjq7jk074","created":1539179363710,"text":"路由表中子网掩码为0.0.0.0的记录表示“默认路由”。","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bozdjrryxlhc","created":1539179367122,"text":"包的有效期","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bozdk990p6o0","created":1539179405158,"text":"网络包转发出去后，还需要更新IP头部中的TTL（Time to Live， 生存时间），TTL规定了包最多能经过多少个路由器的转发（过期时间）","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bozdlo90swzk","created":1539179516174,"text":"分片功能拆分大网络包","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bozdm7x7b7cw","created":1539179558995,"text":"转发的包长度超过了输出端口能传输的最大长度","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bozdmggtik1s","created":1539179577595,"text":"使用 IP 协议中定义的分片功能对包进行拆分，缩 短每个包的长度","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bozdmpjjf7r4","created":1539179597351,"text":"路由器的发送操作与计算机相同","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bozdoao6nksg","created":1539179721708,"text":"路由器与交换机的关系","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bozdoh63ag3k","created":1539179735852,"text":"IP(路由器)负责将包送达通信对象这一整体过程，","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bozdoqfup3i8","created":1539179756033,"text":"其中将包传输到下一个路由器的过程则是由以太网(交换机)来负责的。","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"bozcswj9crgg","created":1539177261646,"text":"路由器的其他功能","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bp0738v26z28","created":1539262705420,"text":"地址转换","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bp0764auag3k","created":1539262930583,"text":"原因：IPv4地址不够用，因此在内网IP会被转成私有地址","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bp076rydy4u8","created":1539262982073,"text":"原理：转发网络包时对IP头部中的IP地址和端口号进行改写","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bp0788l02zgg","created":1539263096633,"text":"从互联网访问服务器局域网：事先将地址和端口的关联信息添加到地址转换设备的对应表","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bp073bivansw","created":1539262711213,"text":"包过滤","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bp078o4q5clc","created":1539263130477,"text":"根据 MAC 头部、IP 头部、TCP 头部的内容 ，按事先设置好的规则决定是转发还是丢弃这个包","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"bp07axae1q0w","created":1539263307139,"text":"互联网内部和网络运营商","priority":4,"expandState":"collapse"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bp07bg4qagow","created":1539263348156,"text":"ADSL接入网的结构和工作方式","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bp07czscjuo0","created":1539263469307,"text":"含义：ADSL:Asymmetric Digital Subscriber Line，不对称数字用户线。利用架设在电线杆上的金属电话线来进行高速通信的技术","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bp07dkg54ow0","created":1539263514281,"text":"特点：它的上行方向(用户到互联网)和下行方向(互联网到用户)的通信速率是不对称的。","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bp07enrbhdz4","created":1539263599852,"text":"互联网接入路由器会在网络包前面加上MAC头部、PPPoE头部、PPP头部总共3种头部，然后发送给ADSL Modem (PPPoE方式下)。","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bp07ewvfrk00","created":1539263619692,"text":"ADSL Modem将包拆分成信元，并转换成电信号发送给分离器。","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bp07f506y0w0","created":1539263637393,"text":"ADSL通过使用多个波来提高速率","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bp07bsyrmfi8","created":1539263376093,"text":"光纤接入网（FTTH）","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bp07ddz2wow0","created":1539263500189,"text":"含义：FTTH:Fiber To The Home，光纤到户。指的是将光纤接入家庭","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bp07g3q69ou8","created":1539263712975,"text":"单模和多模","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bp07c1uvn8qo","created":1539263395449,"text":"接入网中的PPP和隧道","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bp07ea4smy2o","created":1539263570191,"text":"含义：Point-to-Point Protocol，点到点协议。它是电话线、ISDN 等通信线路所使用的一种协议，集成了用户认证、配置下发、数据压缩、加密等各种功能","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bp07ggfd81kw","created":1539263740620,"text":"PPPoE是将PPP消息装入以太网包进行传输的方式。","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bp07gpfg3ke8","created":1539263760216,"text":"通过隧道将网络包发送给运营商","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bp07gwqmxmo0","created":1539263776130,"text":"基于TCP连接的隧道","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bp07h6f9rjsw","created":1539263797210,"text":"基于封装(encapsulation)的隧道","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"bp07cbmmeeww","created":1539263416718,"text":"网络运营商（ISP）内部","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bp07hvke49vk","created":1539263851939,"text":"POP:Point of Presense：网络包通过接入网之后，到达运营商POP的路由器。","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bp07io542txc","created":1539263914142,"text":"NOC:Network Operation Center，网络运行中心：运营商的核心设备，从POP传来的网络包都会集中到这里被转发到离目的地更近的 POP，或是转发到其他的运营商","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bp07cgqt16gw","created":1539263427855,"text":"跨越运营商的网络包","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bp07jrw760hs","created":1539264000675,"text":"运营商之间的连接","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bp07kfu51tds","created":1539264052793,"text":"根据路由表查找的目标地址来转发包","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bp07keet4v7k","created":1539264049689,"text":"运营商之间的路由信息交换","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bp07kupjcohs","created":1539264085166,"text":"运营商之间交换路由信息，并对路由器进行自动更新的","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"bp07liz5q3nk","created":1539264137991,"text":"服务器端的局域网","priority":5,"expandState":"collapse"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bp07lynzgs8w","created":1539264172144,"text":"Web服务器的部署地点","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bp07ne1oypds","created":1539264283988,"text":"直接部署在LAN公司内网","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bp07nukzjc3k","created":1539264319984,"text":"优点：方便","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bp07o6fdywao","created":1539264345766,"text":"缺点1：IP 地址不足。需要为LAN中所有设备分配公有地址。","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bp07oy1k9ji8","created":1539264405880,"text":"缺点2：安全问题。互联网传来的网络包会无节制地进入服务器，服务器裸奔","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bp07pfwpk6bk","created":1539264444769,"text":"部署在防火墙","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bp07ps5odeyo","created":1539264471433,"text":"只允许发往指定服务器的指定应用程序的网络包通过，屏蔽不允许通过的包","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bp07q5fuwirk","created":1539264500346,"text":"部署在数据中心","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bp07qhr2yygw","created":1539264527147,"text":"把服务器放在网络运 营商等管理的数据中心里，或者直接租用运营商提供的服务器","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bp07qnao5r0g","created":1539264539215,"text":"可以获得很高的访问速度；比放在公司里具有更高的安全性 ","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"bp07m508jny8","created":1539264185945,"text":"防火墙的结构和原理","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bp07udpwr85c","created":1539264831825,"text":"过滤方式","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bp07r5cfs8hs","created":1539264578504,"text":"包过滤","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bp07rh4d3lz4","created":1539264604137,"text":"规则：检查网络包的头部的用于控制通信操作的控制信息","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bp07s7vel2ww","created":1539264662368,"text":"通过端口号限定应用程序","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bp07sbukdgjk","created":1539264671025,"text":"通过控制位判断连接方向","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bp07sy71ckjk","created":1539264719668,"text":"包过滤方式的防火墙可根据接收方IP地址、发送方IP地址、接 收方端口号、发送方端口号、控制位等信息来判断是否允许某个包通过。","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bp07rd2pafi8","created":1539264595329,"text":"应用层网关","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bp07rfmch8g0","created":1539264600871,"text":"电路层网关","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bp07t99hck5c","created":1539264743761,"text":"防火墙无法抵御的攻击","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bp07tk9rkuf4","created":1539264767722,"text":"防火墙只根据包的起点和终点来判断是否允许其通过，无法检查包中的数据内容","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"bp07ma0ms9a8","created":1539264196853,"text":"将请求平均分配给多台服务器，平衡负载","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bp07vuy78s8w","created":1539264947696,"text":"分布式架构","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bp07uz7lj4zk","created":1539264878607,"text":"原因：服务器性能不足时负载均衡。e.g. 高速线路传输大量的网络包 ","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bp07wc65bwg0","created":1539264985182,"text":"缺陷：可能无法跳过故障的Web服务器；动态网页单操作跨多个页面，服务器发生变化时操作无法继续","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bp07xxdhi6f4","created":1539265109702,"text":"负载均衡器","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bp07y2byhi4g","created":1539265120494,"text":"用负载均衡器的 IP 地址代替 Web 服务器的实际 地址注册到 DNS 服务器上","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bp07y8f7n1ts","created":1539265133751,"text":"客户端会认为负载均衡器就是一台 Web 服务器，并向其发送请求","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bp07yeapz01s","created":1539265146540,"text":"由负载均衡器来判断将请求转发给哪台 Web 服务器","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"bp07mmubpqf4","created":1539264224770,"text":"利用缓存服务器分担负载","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bp07yzohmy9s","created":1539265193085,"text":"将整个系统按功能分成不同的服务器 ，如 Web 服务器、数据库服务器。","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bp07z68e04cg","created":1539265207349,"text":"缓存服务器是一台通过代理机制对数据进行缓存的服务器，是一种按功能来分担负载的方法。","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bp07zjf8f7cw","created":1539265236061,"text":"缓存服务器通过更新时间管理内容","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bp080767xvcw","created":1539265287759,"text":"代理","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bp080bifjh1c","created":1539265297204,"text":"正向代理","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bp080sqhri0w","created":1539265334697,"text":"代理(Proxy)本来的意思是先把消息收下来，然后“伪装”成原始客户端向 Web 服务器发出访问请求","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bp08158i4cn4","created":1539265361908,"text":"代理在转发过程中可以查看请求的内容，所以可以根据内 容判断是否允许访问","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bp081fzv9mo0","created":1539265385330,"text":"需要在浏览器中进行设置","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bp080gvl1ngg","created":1539265308885,"text":"反向代理reverse proxy","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bp082tnip2ps","created":1539265493422,"text":"将请求消息中的 URI 中的目录名 与 Web 服务器进行关联，使代理能够转发不包含完整网址的请求 消息","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bp081u69yz9c","created":1539265416192,"text":"透明代理transparent proxy","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bp082492mkn4","created":1539265438129,"text":"查看请求消息的包头 部。包的 IP 头部中包含接收方 IP 地址，得知用户要访问哪台服务器","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"bp07ms20aio0","created":1539264236118,"text":"内容分发服务","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bp0834yhzf9c","created":1539265518031,"text":"利用内容分发服务分担负载：内容分发服务也叫 CDS(Content Delivery Service)。现也叫 CDN(Content Delivery Network 或 Content Distribution Network","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bp083jc5bytc","created":1539265549331,"text":"缓存服务器部署方式区别","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bp083y1ruzgg","created":1539265581357,"text":"服务器端：可以减轻 Web 服务器的负载，但无法减少互联网中的流量","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bp0846funzeo","created":1539265599621,"text":"在客户端部署：减少网络拥塞点的影响，让网络流量更稳定，Web服务器运营中无法控制客户端的缓存服务器","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bp08615oqqkg","created":1539265744851,"text":"部署在互联网边缘：降低网络流量，服务器运营中还可以控制缓存服务器","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bp087vcixrsw","created":1539265888932,"text":"使用内容分发服务","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bp0882os1rls","created":1539265904910,"text":"找到最近的缓存服务器","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bp088aog3i80","created":1539265922305,"text":"通过重定向服务器分配访问目标","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bp088ubsqxa8","created":1539265965075,"text":"缓存的更新方法会影响性能","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bp089146osn4","created":1539265979853,"text":"Web 服务器在原始数据发生更新时立即通知缓存服务器，这样缓存服务器就不需要对原始数据进行确认","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bp089iqzxiww","created":1539266018237,"text":"内容分发服务采用的缓存服务器就具备这样的功能","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"bp08a58dmkn4","created":1539266067177,"text":"Web服务器响应返回浏览器","priority":6,"expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bp08aojsz1fk","created":1539266109227,"text":"服务器概览","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bp0liy3qux34","created":1539303431366,"text":"服务器与客户端","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bp0ljcu7smww","created":1539303463442,"text":"服务器：等待连接操作；可以和多台客户端进行通信","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bp0ljdcq2kg0","created":1539303464561,"text":"客户端：发起连接操作","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bp08c1mmruo0","created":1539266216061,"text":"服务器结构","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bp0livy9oyrk","created":1539303426681,"text":"等待连接模块：一对多","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bp0lkkn3n9j4","created":1539303558790,"text":"通信模块：一对一","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bp08cr6jj0n4","created":1539266271684,"text":"套接字和端口","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bp0ln4ckdlhc","created":1539303758417,"text":"客户端数据收发","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bp0ln7w1js3k","created":1539303766125,"text":"创建套接字","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bp0lnd3dvaww","created":1539303777453,"text":"用管道连接服务端的套接字","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bp0lnj8su3nk","created":1539303790841,"text":"收发数据","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bp0lnluv979c","created":1539303796529,"text":"断开管道并删除套接字","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bp0lnpxsgkcg","created":1539303805413,"text":"服务器端","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bp0lnuswzdhc","created":1539303816002,"text":"创建套接字","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bp0lny5dcrgg","created":1539303823285,"text":"将套接字设置为等待连接状态；接受连接","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bp0loaxllb0g","created":1539303851113,"text":"收发数据","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bp0lod9cak8w","created":1539303856177,"text":"断开管道并删除套接字","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bp0loszobg1s","created":1539303890421,"text":"协议栈判断包的去向","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bp0lrcuc5eyo","created":1539304090362,"text":"原因：服务端存在端口相同套接字，客户端套接字都对应不同的端口号","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bp0lrk87cxz4","created":1539304106438,"text":"要素","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bp0lpvmaeww0","created":1539303974506,"text":"客户端IP地址，客户端端口号"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bp0lq8ux62gw","created":1539304003326,"text":"服务端IP地址，服务端端口号"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"bp0lrtm40uf4","created":1539304126870,"text":"使用描述符来指代套接字","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bp0ls06789hc","created":1539304141146,"text":"等待连接的套接字中没有客户端IP地址和端口号","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bp0ls30vd7nk","created":1539304147354,"text":"使用描述符这一种信息比较简单","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"bp08arjb2lfk","created":1539266115727,"text":"服务器接收","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bp0ls8vrqadc","created":1539304160106,"text":"网卡将接收到的电信号/光信号转成数字信息","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bp0m7nlr2tq8","created":1539305367614,"text":"包到达服务器，网卡接收信号并采用中断机制通知CPU","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bp0lsp9ug3y8","created":1539304195786,"text":"网卡的MAC模块将网络包从信号还原为数字信息，校验FCS并存入缓冲区。","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bp0lsvhegt8g","created":1539304209303,"text":"网卡驱动会根据MAC头部判断协议类型，并将包交给相应的协议栈。","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bp0lsxdcc45c","created":1539304213411,"text":"IP模块的接收操作","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bp0ltvrwaqkg","created":1539304288302,"text":"协议栈收到网络包，IP模块开始工作","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bp0lvkd9r7r4","created":1539304420201,"text":"检查IP头部","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bp0lu3c7vthc","created":1539304304768,"text":"接收方IP地址（不是自己的包会转发）","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bp0lumaw7jls","created":1539304346047,"text":"包是否被分片：分片的包等所有分片到达之后组装还原","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bp0lvavqwlc0","created":1539304399551,"text":"协议号字段：根据其将包转交给相应的模块（TCP/UDP）","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"bp0lwt49gdfk","created":1539304517612,"text":"TCP模块处理包","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bp0lxq2t505c","created":1539304589358,"text":"收到发起连接的包","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bp0lx5o1mn7k","created":1539304544929,"text":"(1) 确认TCP头 部的控制位SYN","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bp0lxvx1eqkg","created":1539304602069,"text":"(2) 检查接收方端口号","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bp0lxzna4mbk","created":1539304610187,"text":"(3) 为相应的等待连 接套接字复制一个新的副本;","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bp0ly2ua15vk","created":1539304617140,"text":"(4) 记录发送方IP地址和端口号等信息","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bp0ly79wisxs","created":1539304626792,"text":"处理数据包","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bp0lyfa5l1xc","created":1539304644221,"text":"(1) 根据收到的包的发送方IP地 址、发送方端口号、接收方IP地址、接收方端口号找到相对应的套接字","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bp0lyg1kkbnk","created":1539304645879,"text":"(2) 将数据块拼合起来并保存在接收缓冲区中","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bp0lyy0nln9c","created":1539304685006,"text":"(3) 向客户端返回ACK","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bp0lz5mednnk","created":1539304701558,"text":"断开操作","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bp0lzi44xmv4","created":1539304728752,"text":"根据HTTP协议版本，断开操作由服务端和客户端发起略有不同（HTTP1.0由服务端发起）","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bp0m09icvsow","created":1539304788385,"text":"四次挥手；断开操作完成后，套接字会在经过一段时间后删除","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"bp08b0ishmv4","created":1539266135287,"text":"服务器解释并响应请求消息","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bp0m0pfpzl6o","created":1539304823055,"text":"将请求的URI转换成实际的文件名：客户端看到的目录结构和服务端实际目录结构不同","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bp0m1we7zri8","created":1539304916565,"text":"运行CGI程序","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bp0mazqro64g","created":1539305629132,"text":"CGI含义：Common Gateway Interface，通用网关接口","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bp0mavc4qhhc","created":1539305619539,"text":"如URI指定的内容是一个程序，客户端数据会通过CGI这个接口从Web服务器进入到CGI程序，服务器会运行这个程序然后将输出数据返回","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bp0m2y8q4rnk","created":1539304998951,"text":"Web服务器的访问控制规则","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bp0m34qbxzb4","created":1539305013076,"text":"客户端IP地址：是否允许该IP地址访问","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bp0m35icutq8","created":1539305014770,"text":"客户端域名：根据客户端IP地址查询客户端域名via DNS服务器","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bp0m35ntm0w0","created":1539305015101,"text":"用户名和密码","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bp0m4jfh8bnk","created":1539305123435,"text":"返回响应消息","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bp0m4vk1voxs","created":1539305149833,"text":"Web 服务器调用 Socket 库的 write，将响应消息交给协议栈","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bp0m5dcxiww0","created":1539305188585,"text":"服务器只需要给出套接字的描述符，因为套接字保存了通信状态（包括通信对象的信息）","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bp0m51vcnz0g","created":1539305163577,"text":"协议栈将数据拆分，加上头部信息并发送","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"bp08bblytkao","created":1539266159424,"text":"浏览器接收响应消息并显示内容","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bp0m5ro3lpfk","created":1539305219735,"text":"浏览器通过响应的数据类型content-type判断内容","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bp0m6k3hne9s","created":1539305281616,"text":"浏览器显示网页内容","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]}]}]}]},"template":"right","theme":"fresh-blue","version":"1.4.43"}